<title>UK: Fidelity names acting president for UK brokerage.</title>
<headline>Fidelity names acting president for UK brokerage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity Brokerage Group has named Kenneth Rathgeber as acting president of its UK brokerage, Fidelity Brokerage Services.</p>
<p>He will succeed David Plucinsky, who will take on a special assignment with the company, splitting his time between Boston and London.</p>
<p>Rathgeber, 49, has been in the UK two months and will remain here &quot;until FBS completes an executive search and a permanent president is hired&quot;, a statement said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 6414</p>
</text>
